            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Chittagong College, College Road, Chattogram.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Email: <a href="mailto:ccpacofficial@gmail.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">ccpacofficial@gmail.com</a></p>
            <form id="subscribe-form" class="space-y-2 pt-1">
                <input type="email" placeholder="Your email" required class="w-full px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-400">
